#. module: wedding_planner
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wedding_planner.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<strong>Automated Project Creation: </strong>When a sales order includes a "
"specific service—such as \"MyWeddingCompany Service\"—a corresponding "
"project can automatically be generated based on the predefined product "
"template. This\n"
"        eliminates manual setup and ensures consistency in project execution."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Samodejno ustvarjanje projektov: </strong>Ko prodajno naročilo "
"vključuje določeno storitev, na primer »MyWeddingCompany Service«, je mogoče "
"na podlagi vnaprej določene predloge izdelka samodejno ustvariti ustrezen "
"projekt. To\n"
"        odpravlja ročno nastavitev in zagotavlja doslednost pri izvajanju "
"projekta."

#. module: wedding_planner
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wedding_planner.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<strong>Collaborate with your team</strong> to streamline content creation "
"and approvals."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Sodelujte s svojo ekipo</strong> za poenostavitev ustvarjanja "
"vsebine in odobritev."

#. module: wedding_planner
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wedding_planner.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<strong>Comprehensive Tracking &amp; Insights: </strong>Monitor key project "
"metrics effortlessly. Use the dashboard button within the kanban view to "
"track timesheets, vendor bills, milestones, and other critical indicators, "
"ensuring smooth\n"
"        project management from start to finish."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Celovito sledenje in vpogledi: </strong>Brez težav spremljajte "
"ključne metrike projekta. Z gumbom nadzorne plošče v pogledu kanban "
"spremljajte časovne izkaze, račune dobaviteljev, mejnike in druge kritične "
"kazalnike ter tako zagotovite nemoteno\n"
"        upravljanje projekta od začetka do konca."

#. module: wedding_planner
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wedding_planner.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<strong>Contract &amp; Agreement Handling: </strong>Send, manage, and store "
"contracts or formal agreements within the CRM. Ensure quick approvals, track "
"signatures, and maintain a clear record of all client commitments."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Upravljanje pogodb in sporazumov: </strong>Pošiljajte, upravljajte "
"in shranjujte pogodbe ali formalne sporazume znotraj CRM-ja. Zagotovite "
"hitre odobritve, spremljajte podpise in vzdržujte jasen zapis vseh zavez "
"strank."

#. module: wedding_planner
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wedding_planner.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid "<strong>Create a Website </strong>and link the contact form to your CRM"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Ustvarite spletno mesto </strong>in povežite kontaktni obrazec s "
"svojim CRM-jem"

#. module: wedding_planner
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wedding_planner.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<strong>Follow-Up with your opportunities: </strong>Never miss a follow-up "
"again. Create and assign tasks to team members, set reminders, and track "
"progress to maintain consistent engagement with your leads."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Nadaljnje spremljanje vaših priložnosti: </strong>Nikoli več ne "
"zamudite nadaljnjega spremljanja. Ustvarite in dodelite opravila članom "
"ekipe, nastavite opomnike in spremljajte napredek, da ohranite dosledno "
"sodelovanje s svojimi potencialnimi strankami."

#. module: wedding_planner
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wedding_planner.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<strong>Lead Categorization: </strong>Easily segment and organize your leads "
"with custom tags. This allows for better targeting, prioritization, and "
"personalized outreach, helping you focus on the most promising prospects."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Kategorizacija potencialnih strank: </strong>Svoje potencialne "
"stranke preprosto razdelite in organizirajte z oznakami po meri. To omogoča "
"boljše ciljanje, določanje prednostnih nalog in personalizirano nagovarjanje "
"ter vam pomaga osredotočiti se na najbolj obetavne potencialne stranke."

#. module: wedding_planner
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wedding_planner.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<strong>Manage multi-platform campaigns</strong> effortlessly without "
"switching between accounts."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Upravljajte kampanje na več platformah</strong> brez težav, ne da bi "
"preklapljali med računi."

#. module: wedding_planner
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wedding_planner.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<strong>Multi-Vendor Quotation Requests: </strong>Easily request quotations "
"from multiple vendors and receive competitive offers for your products or "
"services."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Zahteve za ponudbe več dobaviteljev: </strong>Preprosto zahtevajte "
"ponudbe od več dobaviteljev in prejemajte konkurenčne ponudbe za svoje "
"izdelke ali storitve."

#. module: wedding_planner
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wedding_planner.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<strong>Opportunity Management: </strong>Track every stage of your sales "
"process, from initial contact to closing the deal. Log communications, "
"monitor progress, and schedule follow-ups to ensure no opportunity falls "
"through the\n"
"        cracks."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Upravljanje priložnosti: </strong>Spremljajte vsako fazo svojega "
"prodajnega procesa, od prvega stika do sklenitve posla. Beležite "
"komunikacijo, spremljajte napredek in načrtujte nadaljnje stike, da nobena "
"priložnost ne bo\n"
"        spregledana."

#. module: wedding_planner
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wedding_planner.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<strong>Plan, schedule, and publish posts</strong> across all major social "
"media channels."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Načrtujte, razporedite in objavite objave</strong> v vseh glavnih "
"kanalih družbenih omrežij."

#. module: wedding_planner
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wedding_planner.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<strong>Project integration </strong>: Requests for Quotations (RFQs) or "
"vendor orders can be created directly from your customer projects."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Integracija projektov </strong>: Zahtevki za ponudbe (RFQ) ali "
"naročila dobaviteljem se lahko ustvarijo neposredno iz vaših projektov "
"strank."

#. module: wedding_planner
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wedding_planner.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<strong>Quotation Management: </strong>Create professional quotations and "
"share them online in just a few clicks. Track their status, make revisions, "
"and secure approvals efficiently to speed up the sales cycle."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Upravljanje ponudb: </strong>Ustvarite profesionalne ponudbe in jih "
"v le nekaj klikih delite prek spleta. Spremljajte njihov status, jih "
"posodabljajte ter učinkovito pridobite odobritve, da pospešite prodajni "
"cikel."

#. module: wedding_planner
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wedding_planner.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<strong>Sales Order Templates: </strong>Load up predefined sales order "
"templates that include structured sections, products, and essential details. "
"Add extra notes for descriptions and easily include terms &amp; conditions "
"to ensure\n"
"        clarity in every transaction."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Predloge prodajnih naročil: </strong>Naložite vnaprej pripravljene "
"predloge prodajnih naročil, ki vključujejo strukturirane razdelke, izdelke "
"in bistvene podrobnosti. Dodajte dodatne opombe za opise ter preprosto "
"vključite pogoje &amp; določila, da zagotovite\n"
"        jasnost pri vsaki transakciji."

#. module: wedding_planner
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wedding_planner.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<strong>Schedule meetings: </strong>Simplify your calendar through the "
"calendar smart button in the opportunity."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Načrtujte sestanke: </strong>Poenostavite svoj koledar s pametnim "
"gumbom koledarja v priložnosti."

#. module: wedding_planner
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wedding_planner.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<strong>Seamless Purchase Confirmation: </strong>Confirm purchases with "
"selected vendors and coordinate deliveries effortlessly to ensure smooth "
"operations."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Nemotena potrditev nakupa: </strong>Potrdite nakupe pri izbranih "
"dobaviteljih in brez težav usklajujte dostave, da zagotovite nemoteno "
"poslovanje."

#. module: wedding_planner
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wedding_planner.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<strong>Side-by-Side Comparison: </strong>Compare vendor quotations directly "
"using the <strong>\"Compare Product Lines\"</strong> feature to make "
"informed purchasing decisions."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Vzporedna primerjava: </strong>Primerjajte ponudbe dobaviteljev "
"neposredno s funkcijo <strong>»Primerjaj vrstice izdelkov«</strong> za "
"sprejemanje premišljenih nabavnih odločitev."

#. module: wedding_planner
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wedding_planner.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<strong>Task &amp; Subtask Management: </strong>Each project consists of "
"structured tasks essential for preparation, such as wedding planning steps. "
"Tasks can be further broken down into multiple subtasks, each with a "
"detailed view to\n"
"        track progress effectively."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Upravljanje opravil in podopravil: </strong>Vsak projekt je "
"sestavljen iz strukturiranih opravil, ki so bistvena za pripravo, kot so "
"koraki načrtovanja poroke. Opravila je mogoče nadalje razčleniti na več "
"podopravil, pri čemer ima vsako podroben pogled za učinkovito spremljanje "
"napredka.\n"
"        "

#. module: wedding_planner
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wedding_planner.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<strong>Track engagement</strong>, reach, and performance metrics with real-"
"time analytics."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Spremljajte vključenost</strong>, doseg in kazalnike uspešnosti z "
"analitiko v realnem času."

#. module: wedding_planner
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wedding_planner.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<strong>Use the Appointments App</strong> to allow customers to book "
"consultations with you"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Uporabite aplikacijo za sestanke</strong>, da strankam omogočite "
"rezervacijo posvetov z vami"

#. module: wedding_planner
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wedding_planner.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid "<strong>Use the Attendance App</strong> to track when guests arrive"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Uporabite aplikacijo za prisotnost</strong> za spremljanje prihodov "
"gostov"

#. module: wedding_planner
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wedding_planner.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<strong>Vendor Pricing &amp; Agreements: </strong>Leverage vendor price "
"lists or pre-negotiated agreements when applicable, ensuring cost efficiency "
"and consistency."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Ceniki dobaviteljev &amp; dogovori: </strong>Po potrebi izkoristite "
"cenike dobaviteljev ali vnaprej dogovorjene sporazume, s čimer zagotovite "
"stroškovno učinkovitost in doslednost."

#. module: wedding_planner
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wedding_planner.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Add costs to your products and display your margins in the settings app to "
"get an overview of your net profits per sale"
msgstr ""
"Dodajte stroške svojim izdelkom in prikažite svoje marže v aplikaciji "
"Nastavitve, da dobite pregled nad svojimi čistimi dobički na prodajo"

#. module: wedding_planner
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wedding_planner.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"An ideal pre-configured module for your Wedding Planner needs in Odoo, from "
"lead management to project planning and budgeting."
msgstr ""
"Idealen vnaprej konfiguriran modul za vaše potrebe organiziranja porok v "
"Odooju, od upravljanja potencialnih strank do načrtovanja projektov in "
"priprave proračuna."

